  "synopsis": {
    "value": "Coffee Bean & Tea Leaf is a specialty coffee and tea café/qsr brand. Its ownership maps to Jollibee Foods Corporation / The Coffee Bean & Tea Leaf. Canonical pack: 195 units; 110 company-owned / 85 franchisee-owned. The canonical estate mixes company and franchise restaurants, so corporate can validate technology directly while systemwide deployment must also work economically for franchisees. For RBB, the ownership hierarchy should shape account strategy: determine whether technology, payments and procurement decisions sit at brand corporate, a parent platform or the operator level. Priority lenses are POS/payments, digital guest experience, labor impact, operational throughput, reliability and measurable restaurant-level ROI appropriate to the concept.",
